            <ArticleTitle>Can MOOCs meet your learning needs?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>170-172</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1080/17453054.2017.1367253</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This paper looks at the role of Massive Open Online Courses (MOOCs) in fulfilling your learning needs; from looking at what MOOCs are through to examples of courses from different Universities and advice for completing a course. The sequence of activities takes you from looking at your learning needs, to finding a course, thinking about how to plan and prepare for learning using a MOOC then writing a review or reflecting on the impact of your learning.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
